\fs16 An old castle waits to be explored. Crates are scattered everywhere, and what is inside them will give you a valuable edge in the fight. At the start of the round the host sets how many relaunches everyone gets and which clonks are fought with. Nine are on offer: assassin, paladin, knight, magus, kendarian, mystic, clonk, aquaclonk and king.\par
\par
The castle has a moat, towers and cellars, everything a knight's heart could wish for. Fall from the cliff and your fate is sealed. You can also shoot yourself through the sides with a cannon. And somewhere a fair princess is said to be waiting for rescue -- but who will find the key to her cage?\par
\par
Goal: melee (last man standing). Players: 2-12.\par
Requires the MetalMagic.c4d and MetalMagicExtra.c4d packs.\par
